First time at the gates of Gehennom - and almost YAS-S-S-D

For the first time ever I reached the Castle. Now my Wiz 14 Leia is
surveying the devastation she wrought, and watching all the monsters
that showed up during the prolonged nurse dance.

I would like to know if Leia is ready to tackle Gehennom. Her current
vitals are:

200 hp, 194 Pow, AC -19, SDSM, boots of water walking, fooproof
everything, blessed +2 Magicbane, ten blessed +4 daggers, Eye of
Tapioca, amulet of life saving, rings of polycontrol, shock
resistance, conflict, regeneration, levitation, etc, MANY spells
including Finger of Death at 15% failure and Magic Mapping at 20-30%
(but not Identify nor Magic Missile), teleportitis, telecontrol. Fire,
cold, sleep and poison resistant. Between Charm Monster and Create
Familiar, pets should not be a problem. No WoP, and Polymorph spell is
at 77% failure. All c's genocided long time ago (took on both Fort
Ludios and Castle with no rubber chicken), while mind flayers are not.
No wishes (Castle wand already used up) and magic marker dried up.

BTW, with Eye of Aethiopica I can leave Gehennom at any time - but how
are you supposed to leave it otherwise? The way in is through Castle
trapdoors - where is the way out?

The "almost YASD" - and the "S" part would have been hard to top! -
went like this:

Lock myself in one of the Castle corner rooms. Write a cursed SoG.
Reverse-genocide nurses.

Nurse hits. Nurse hits. Nurse hits. Nurse hits. From 120 hp Leia is
down to 80. Oops - forgot to take off armor.

Cast Haste Self, take off armor. By the time I am done, down to 30-
something hp. Now hit points should go up, right?

Nurse hits. Nurse hits. Nurse hits. Nurse hits. Down to 7 hp. Huh?

Was I supposed to (R)emove rings and amulets too? If so, too late to
do that - Leia will be dead if start taking them off. No-teleport
level, and Eye of Aethiopica is in the bag - wearing AoLS. Whatever I
am doing wrong, I think I must accept the loss of AoLS, then put on
the Eye and #invoke out of here...

Nurse hits. You die. But wait! Amulet of Life Saving crumbles. You
rise from the dead. You survived this attempt on your life.

Put on Eye of Tapioca and transport to Fort Ludios. Put the armor back
on. So what went wrong? I forgot to un-wield the Magicbane, that's
what!

Got back to the Castle and did the nurse dance correctly. Used the
time to wrest the last charge out of the Castle wand and wish for
another AoLS.



